      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Order transaction; payout cycle; BIR filing
Frequency: Per transaction + monthly filing
Volume: All marketplace transactions
Owner: Tax Manager
Participants: Tax Mgr, Finance, Marketplace Mgr, Seller, Legal
Source: workflow W3157 — Marketplace Tax (VAT / Percentage Tax) &amp; BIR Compliance per Seller</bpmn:documentation>
