Frequency: Continuous + annual review
Volume: All marketplace buyers
Owner: Marketplace Manager
Participants: Marketplace Mgr, CS (links to VS-13), Legal, Finance, Marketing (links to VS-14)
Source: workflow W3158 — Marketplace Consumer Protection &amp; Trust Program</bpmn:documentation>
