      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3158_Task6" name="Marketplace Mgr/Legal define buyer-protection policy: A-to-Z-style guarantee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Marketplace Mgr/Legal define buyer-protection policy: A-to-Z-style guarantee (refund if seller fails to deliver/resolve), money-back window, item-not-as-described remedy, counterfeit guarantee, holdback fund for unfulfilled orders (links to W3144)
Responsible (R): Marketplace Mgr / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3158_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3158_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3158_Task7" name="CS (links to VS-13) operate trust program: clear claim path, fast adjudication…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CS (links to VS-13) operate trust program: clear claim path, fast adjudication, proactive outreach on systemic issues; Marketing (links to VS-14) communicate guarantee to buyers
Responsible (R): CS / Marketing
Accountable (A): Marketplace Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3158_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3158_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3158_Task8" name="Finance fund buyer-protection reserve from marketplace fees; report claims cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance fund buyer-protection reserve from marketplace fees; report claims cost and trust-score uplift; calibrate policy to balance buyer trust and seller fairness
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3158_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3158_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
