      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3159_Start3" name="Marketplace launch; DPA obligations; privacy incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3159_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3159_Task4" name="DPO map marketplace data flows: customer PII shared with seller (name, address…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DPO map marketplace data flows: customer PII shared with seller (name, address, phone) for fulfillment — Data Privacy Act (DPA) processor/controller arrangement; seller-as-processor agreement; document ROPA (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): DPO / Legal
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Initial + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3159_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3159_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3159_Task5" name="DPO implement seller data governance: minimal PII disclosure (e.g., masked…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DPO implement seller data governance: minimal PII disclosure (e.g., masked phone, address only), retention limits, security requirements for seller handling of PII (links to VS-27), privacy-by-design in portal/API
Responsible (R): DPO / IT Security
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3159_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3159_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3159_Task6" name="On breach (seller or platform): execute 72-hour NPC notification (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On breach (seller or platform): execute 72-hour NPC notification (links to VS-91 PA-91.3), notify affected customers, investigate, remediate, and apply seller sanctions if seller-attributable
Responsible (R): DPO / Marketplace Mgr
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3159_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3159_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
