        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-86 (ensure marketplace seller &amp; tax compliance.) | - operational: minimal-disclosure design, processor agreement, and audit
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
